e.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jLu7rWxqQXWvf96X7Ifr9qQHByy.jpg\"},{\"id\":2328155,\"name\":\"Amine Hamidou\",\"character\":\"Mehdi Allawi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h5rBdHb8RQ62R6Q8v1AcjG7oEz5.jpg\"},{\"id\":2852439,\"name\":\"Léo Chalié\",\"character\":\"Wendy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vmuNIVYP9lbuMcxNa4i3CgXLWuU.jpg\"},{\"id\":1895470,\"name\":\"Grace Seri\",\"character\":\"Ariel\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kSWr5XPA6Xan0nratI2y7GuhnPa.jpg\"},{\"id\":3738649,\"name\":\"Yassine Stein\",\"character\":\"Ahmad\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ziFJxeAB49GR8tFjklqvC2guRo6.jpg\"},{\"id\":135665,\"name\":\"Marc Barbé\",\"character\":\"Mileur\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wx6mwxsSrAZj3PAg8PkUSAQlTbo.jpg\"},{\"id\":96376,\"name\":\"Thierry Hancisse\",\"character\":\"Vano\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u2jwlcR4vcGK8mnrAMk0dGvLTsM.jpg\"},{\"id\":5349065,\"name\":\"Mohammed Shiaa Alzaidawi\",\"character\":\"Hassan\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2548884,\"name\":\"Déborah Lamy\",\"character\":\"Gaëtane\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dJEppmneMPoAOqPNiSZSPg1VydK.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":755898,\"title\":\"War of the Worlds\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yvirUYrva23IudARHn3mMGVxWqM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iZLqwEwUViJdSkGVjePGhxYzbDb.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Will Radford is a top analyst for Homeland Security who tracks potential threats through a mass surveillance program, until one day an attack by an unknown entity leads him to question whether the government is hiding something from him... and from the rest of the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1101383,\"title\":\"The End of Oak Street\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7DmtuAK5gYGlMFA45Oxkl1bEpIC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w9AiymbmQGt3jdtsm78HdfKkChy.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a mysterious cosmic event rips Oak Street from suburbia and transports their neighborhood to someplace unknown, the Platt family soon discovers that their very survival depends on them sticking together as they navigate their now unrecognizable surroundings.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1384216,\"title\":\"The Dog Stars\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5O616X9vmRzQdB68PHzBewPittd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3k7GzxOdLZkN3eZsuhLi2eRzkXO.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the world's population has been ravaged by a pandemic, a man lives a lonesome existence in a Colorado airplane hangar with his dog and a dour gunman he has befriended. When a mysterious transmission comes through on the radio while he’s flying his old Cessna, it sparks a hunt for the provenance of the sound.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1400940,\"title\":\"Clayface\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9l1NuFjel2j89hiuiJbsxfblqjy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f1TVhqJJdxMvUsUDuKHS0ekgYkk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Matt Hagen's meteoric rise from Gotham street kid to Hollywood leading man is tragically cut short when a local crime boss's actions leave him horribly disfigured. Abandoned by his team and with nothing left, Matt seeks out a cutting edge treatment that miraculously returns him to his former self… but also unexpectedly affects his grip on reality, spiraling him down a destructive path of all-consuming revenge.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":131631,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: Mockingjay - Part 1\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4FAA18ZIja70d1Tu5hr5cj2q1sB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lV1P1Q5gLDXVG1ZYCxZHStkcQC3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After surviving the Quarter Quell, Katniss finds herself in the hidden stronghold of District 13, where the rebellion against the Capitol is gaining momentum. Struggling with the weight of becoming the symbol of resistance, she must navigate fragile alliances while trying to protect those she loves. As propaganda battles rage and Panem moves closer to full-scale war, Katniss is forced to confront the true cost of revolution.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1275779,\"title\":\"Disclosure Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AnJ8IQJI23hNpYXVNaythu061Ru.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1e0KDRYKRPHiVNj8yQKYuU2jVyQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A cybersecurity expert becomes a whistleblower after uncovering secrets about aliens, putting him on the run from a corporation. Meanwhile, a meteorologist experiencing strange phenomena joins forces with him to prove there's life beyond our understanding.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1265609,\"title\":\"War Machine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rFhKkXhk7ClU03jQ5rHIApJDwev.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6yeVcxFR0j08vlv2OlL6zbewm4D.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On one last grueling mission during Army Ranger training, a combat engineer must lead his unit in a fight against a giant otherworldly killing machine.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":198663,\"title\":\"The Maze Runner\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ode14q7WtDugFDp78fo9lCsmay9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eTlcNXGv32zkVI7ZDHhfeaKHXKQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A teenager with no memory of his past finds himself among a group of boys living in a walled enclosure surrounded by a massive, ever-changing maze. As he struggles to adapt to their rules and society, he begins to uncover clues that may lead to escape and the truth behind their confinement.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":840464,\"title\":\"Greenland 2: Migration\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z2tqCJLsw6uEJ8nJV8BsQXGa3dr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cLFbDVfhllIMybpo2fkGNzehiQG.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Having found the safety of the Greenland bunker after the comet Clarke decimated the Earth, the Garrity family must now risk everything to embark on a perilous journey across the wasteland of Europe to find a new home.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":577922,\"title\":\"Tenet\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rrKH3VhHssGTCfPuaEQkxvEoElv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mQOUyqDybTqxl73hO5LujCZsM1o.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Armed with only one word - Tenet - and fighting for the survival of the entire world, the Protagonist journeys through a twilight world of international espionage on a mission that will unfold in something beyond real time.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":950396,\"title\":\"The Gorge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7iMBZzVZtG0oBug4TfqDb9ZxAOa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9nhjGaFLKtddDPtPaX5EmKqsWdH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two highly trained operatives grow close from a distance after being sent to guard opposite sides of a mysterious gorge. When an evil below emerges, they must work together to survive what lies within.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22034,\"title\":\"Tangier\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/klDfluixEz58gMQMGPw1LtNE9cO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qDN9ebaXpLdyRvcN0LIX0sU6sMV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In August 1996, bus drivers Marcel Van Loock and Wim Moreels are apprehended by the Moroccan Customs for drug trafficking. Inside their bus, hidden behind a false compartment, they have discovered 700 pounds of hashish. Although the owner of the bus company is arrested as well and makes a full confession clearly indicating that both drivers were unaware of the hidden drugs, the Moroccan judge sentences both men to 5 years in the Moroccan prison of Tangiers. Nothing could have prepared the two men for life inside a Moroccan prison. Without food, clothes or medical care, they must learn how to take care of themselves to survive their stay in prison. Corrupt guards, corrupt lawyers and judges, a consul who doesn't care and frequent beatings are only part of the terrible prison. Meanwhile their families at home are left without any information, any help or any hope - finding out that their own government doesn't care for Belgian people in prisons abroad.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"DXQDZbS8l5Q\",\"name\":\"Planet B  (2024) | Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}